<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Motor Feb vehicle sales fall.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Motor Feb vehicle sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's largest car maker, Hyundai Motor Co Ltd said on Wednesday its vehicle sales in February fell to 82,471 units from 87,244 a year-earlier period.</p>
<p>A Hyundai spokesman said an economic slowdown was largely to blame for the fall.</p>
